WEBVTT

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.640
I wonder which one I should wear to make Minato-kun happy.

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.210
The Sekirei sign...

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.170
If I touch this and recite the ritual prayer...

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.190
Hey, Uzume-chan...

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:21.210
Miya told me earlier...

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:25.470
She told me that all the costumes here serve to cheer someone up.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Your Ashikabi must be a wonderful person if you care about her so much.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:38.520
Yeah, she's just as nice as Sahashi-chan.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.840
You can have them, Nee-san. Take anything you want.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:44.860
But...

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:45.870
It's fine...

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.960
I've already seen her smile many times before.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:51.380
So... it's fine...

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.630
Well... Actually, I have to go somewhere.

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.060
You have to go somewhere?

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:01.010
And I don't know when I'll be back yet.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.950
So you can have them... All of them...

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:19.260
atarashii yakusoku ga kokoro wo tsuyoku tsunagu

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:19.260
Our new promise binds our hearts together strongly

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:26.350
kawaru sekai ni kane ga hibiku yukou

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:26.350
The bell rings in the changing world, let's go

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:33.190
owari naki tatakai ga subete wo hiki saitemo

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:33.190
Even if the endless fight shreds everything apart,

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:39.370
kimi no hohoemi tada shinjite

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:39.370
I will believe in your smile

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.580
kimi no yume mamoreru nara

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.580
If I can protect your dream,

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.170
itami sae dakishimeyou

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.170
I will even embrace pain

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:56.470
kasane au kono omoi mune no chikai yuzurenai

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:56.470
I can't let go of these piling feelings, this oath in my heart

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:03.220
aa, sora no haruka hate made

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:03.220
Ah, all the way to the end of the sky,

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:11.440
sou, kakete yuku you na kasoku shiteku jounetsu

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.020
yes, my passion accelerates

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:11.440
as if it were rushing through my body

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:17.610
aa, donna unmei datte

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:17.610
Ah, no matter what kind of fate awaits me,

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:28.750
sou, takaku koeteku makenai yuuki kureta kara

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.910
yes, I can fly high over it

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:28.750
because you gave me this undefeatable courage

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:39.500
Fourth Wing

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:39.500
The Last One

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:42.630
The celebration of Minato-kun's return and our wedding party have now begun!

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:46.430
K-Kazehana-san... Did you get that from Uzume-san as well?

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.800
I did! It suits me perfectly, don't you think?

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:52.470
I-In a way... it suits you too perfectly...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.320
Oh, speaking of which, where's Uzume-san?

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.630
I'll go get her.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.050
Oh, Uzume-san?

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:03.480
Are you going out somewhere?

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.710
I have something to take care of.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.230
Oh, I see.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:09.160
I'm sorry,

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:12.410
even though today's your return party.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:15.370
Nah, it's fine if you have something else planned.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:20.770
Uzume-san.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.460
We'll save your share for you, so make sure you come back soon!

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.320
Be careful.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.790
What's wrong?

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.940
Oh, it's nothing...

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.260
Mina-tan!

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.450
Minato, what are you doing?!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.960
I'm coming!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.420
Let's go, Kuu-chan.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.020
Okay!

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.440
Onii-chan?

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.020
Oh, sorry...

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:57.250
Uzume-san had something to do, so she's going out.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.000
That's too bad.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.170
Uzume-tan's party tricks would have been perfect for this occasion.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:06.130
Then someone call Kagari! Get Kagari over here!

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.300
Tsukiumi, are you drunk already?!

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:11.390
Is this going to be a long trip,

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.510
Uzume-san?

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.400
Miya...

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:23.150
I will leave your room as it is.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:31.590
Come in.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:37.910
Um, we're having a party... So if you like...

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.640
Huh? Oh...

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.580
Never mind, I'll be right there.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.620
All right, we'll be waiting.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.670
What was that feeling just now?

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:55.840
Very well. If Uzume won't be here, I'll let you see some of my awesome water tricks instead!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:59.720
Crap! Don't!

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:03.380
The Landlady will get mad if you spill water all over the place!

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.520
I wonder why...

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:08.820
Lately, I get angry for no reason whenever I see this guy.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:15.010
He's too cheerful and friendly.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.240
Minato...

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:21.250
Consider yourself dead if you dare to eat that!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.050
T-Tsukiumi...

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:27.090
He's already losing an argument that hasn't even started yet...

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.960
His self-confidence is pretty much non-existent.

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:32.880
Just looking at him pisses me off.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.840
Wh-What's the matter, Kagari-san?

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.430
Oh, it's nothing...

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.020
Thank you for the meal.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.680
U-Um, Kagari-san?

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:48.810
You haven't drank much, and you didn't eat anything at all...

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.110
I don't have much of an appetite.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.700
You seem to be taking a break from work quite often lately, too...

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.650
Are you not feeling well?

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:57.570
Th-This guy...

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.630
A guy...

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.530
Eh?

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:04.830
Why would I ever let another guy worry about my own body?!

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.070
Anyway... Don't worry about me.

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:16.360
Ka-Kagari-san...

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:19.390
Ouch...

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.820
I was trying not to think about it...

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.390
But my body...

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.810
It can't be...

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:34.400
Is my body reacting... to a guy?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.570
Listen, Musubi-chan...

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.510
I wonder if Kagari-san hates me or something.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:47.090
Really?

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:51.080
It feels like there's a lot of tension between us...

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.000
But you can look at it this way:

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:55.460
When someone hates you, it means they like you.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.630
Huh?

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:57.940
Didn't you know?

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:02.550
Musubi-chan, I think you've misunderstood...

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.640
Huh? Did I just say something weird?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:14.700
Why... Why am I...

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.130
Why am I the only one with this kind of body?!

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:20.910
Answer me, Minaka!

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.570
It's a game.

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:25.080
Everything is a part of an entertaining game.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:30.410
If being in that position is causing you such misery,

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:33.740
then show me how you'd fight against it.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:40.410
Once you've reached the extremes of your emotions, you'll understand the reason behind everything!

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.380
There we go.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:47.730
Are we done with the laundry now?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:48.490
Yup!

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.330
A beautiful sunset, isn't it?

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:55.220
It is.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:59.070
It feels like everything that's happened was nothing but a dream.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:02.590
Hmm... I think they call this...

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.240
the calm before the storm!

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.490
Eh?!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.370
Am I right?

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:10.410
Uh... Suddenly it doesn't feel so peaceful any more...

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:14.270
Oh? Did I say something weird again?

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:19.410
I really need to follow your habits, and study you some more.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.820
Study, eh?

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.630
Study! Study!

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.800
DAMMIT, STUDY?!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.680
I haven't been studying at all!

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:30.730
Wait... I'm an examinee...!

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:34.900
Ow, I drank a little too much...

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:41.220
Oh, crap! I forgot to hand in my application for the summer classes because of everything that's happened!

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:44.110
A-And the deadline's long passed!

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:47.340
Oh, Mina-tan, about that...

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.290
Ah, Matsu-san?

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:53.210
Matsu Special: Ability Test?

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.560
It's just a quick evaluation.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:58.800
Bring it back to me when you're finished.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.630
W-Wait... Matsu-san?!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.790
This looks difficult!

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:06.720
Is it difficult?

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.840
Man, this came out of nowhere...

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:12.190
I'm back!

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.230
I won this match!

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:20.370
Y-You... cheated...

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:24.820
You used your wind manipulation to lighten the weight!

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:27.280
Oh? Are you a sore loser?

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:29.030
What did you say?!

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.410
Is this... another shopping competition?

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.760
Yep! The winner will go against me!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.330
So you're the one hosting this event, huh?

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:40.280
Even so, they were drunk just a moment ago...

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.380
They sure do recover fast.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:01.120
It's a game.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.440
Everything is a part of an entertaining game.

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.720
Damn it!

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:11.680
Homura, you're probably a prototype of the Sekirei.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.370
We can't tell for sure, though.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.390
Even though we did our best to make several adjustments,

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:21.090
your power will probably remain unstable until you're winged.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:23.900
Well, your gender is unstable too...

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:28.020
Even if you can be winged, there won't be many Ashikabi who would wing you.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:31.820
However, if you happen to react to someone,

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.530
your body will adapt to suit your Ashikabi.

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:39.060
Asama Takehito!

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:45.650
If you can prove that my body really is changing due to a reaction to someone...

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:48.110
I won't accept this! I won't accept this at all!

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.030
You're welcome to challenge me any time!

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:55.450
This anxiety and hatred seeping from within my heart is trying to reject the reaction.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.610
I can't stand that attitude of yours!

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.190
What do I want to do?

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:01.290
What do I need to do?

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:04.710
Don't fight! We should try to get along with each other!

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:05.790
Dammit!

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.920
Everyone's acting so carefree while I'm this troubled!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.550
Oh, Kagari-san!

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.010
You were here already?

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:22.660
You guys...

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:24.540
I'm a man, you know...

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.300
Don't you have any shame?!

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:28.390
Why don't you just close your eyes then?

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:32.340
I have nothing to be ashamed of.

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:34.860
These people...

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:35.760
Excuse us,

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:38.830
we didn't realize that you were already in here.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:39.680
Kagari-san,

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.980
would you like me to wash your back for you?

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:43.370
No, it's okay.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.850
I'm fine, so just leave me alone.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.550
Tsukiumi-san,

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:47.700
Kazehana-san,

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.470
let's wash each other's backs.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:53.690
My skin will peel off if you wash my back with that brute strength of yours.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:57.140
Nooo, where will my skin peel off?

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.840
I can't get out like this...

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.620
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.730
Didn't you hear something like a scream coming from the bathroom?

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:09.830
A scream?

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.140
How's it going, Mina-tan?

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:14.920
Ah, I just finished.

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:17.090
It was easier than I thought.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.760
Oh, you seem quite confident about this.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.560
Well, let me take a look.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.140
H-How did I do?

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.360
M-Matsu-san?

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:40.530
These are modified questions based on the Shin-Touteitou University's entrance exam. I've made them much harder.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:43.690
Oh, really?

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:46.400
How did you manage to fail twice with this kind of score?!

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:46.960
Huh?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:49.170
Everything's correct.

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:49.980
Really?!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.300
Yay!

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:52.710
You're amazing, Onii-chan!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.050
Like I said...!

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.470
How did you manage to fail twice?!

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:00.840
There should be a limit to how nervous you get during the real thing!

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:02.930
Listen up!

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:06.920
Mina-tan, you have no need to attend the summer courses or anything like that!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.600
B-But...

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:11.570
What you lack is confidence.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:17.190
Mina-tan, it's about time you start to believe in your own potential.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.610
My potential...

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.000
I-If something goes wrong...

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:32.660
I'll just work my magic on the university's server, and I'll make sure you pass easily!

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:36.170
Th-That's so...

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:40.230
Onii-chan!

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:41.270
Thanks.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:42.710
A message?

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:50.310
So you really don't know where the No. 108 is, right?

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:53.010
I-I told you I don't know!

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:54.730
Dammit, you perverted bitch!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:55.980
Really?

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:58.860
Then... I have no further use for you!

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:03.050
Th-That must've hurt...

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:08.040
You've been acting kind of mad ever since you weren't able to see your brother...

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.710
Ah... Another waste of time...

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:15.420
A message?

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.720
What's up, Mikogami?

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.140
Things are about to get interesting.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.180
Akitsu, can you do me a favour?

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:32.560
Higa-sama, we've received this message...

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.730
Can we get in touch with her?

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:37.900
Any time you wish.

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:48.370
It's nearly time for your night shift!

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.870
You'll be late if you don't get up.

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:53.120
Is it that late already?

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.750
Ah... So soft...

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.880
W-Wait- Don't get carried away!

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.590
Dammit! You're annoying!

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:05.430
Tonight's dinner...

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.140
What should I make?

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:09.220
We're out of rice as well.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.260
Seo, I think you've got a message!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.400
A message?

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.670
This is the president of M.B.I., Minaka Hiroto.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.880
To all the Ashikabi I'm sending this message to:

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:26.210
I have a highly interesting piece of information for you today.

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:31.420
The last unwinged Sekirei is located in the Northern area.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:37.140
Yukari-san said that Minato-san has exclusive rights to my breasts!

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.340
What did you say?!

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:40.140
His sister acknowledged you?

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.380
You're not bad, considering you're a klutz.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:46.760
Damn you! If only the Disciplinary Squad hadn't gotten in my way...!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.920
First come, first serve.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.430
The one to wing her could be you!

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.690
The last... unwinged?

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:56.100
Now that I think about it, back when Kuu-chan...

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.520
Kuu?

00:15:57.900 --> 00:16:01.880
Um... I received a similar message back when I met the girl in green-

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.630
The president's done it this time!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:05.990
That hurts, Matsu-san!

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:08.280
This message is almost the same.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:12.390
Minaka is stirring up the Ashikabi again!

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:17.330
Speaking of which, this is the Northern area that Seo-san mentioned before...

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.290
They're all going to gather here.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:24.190
The Ashikabi wanting to wing the last Sekirei will all gather here!

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:24.930
Mina-tan!

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.720
Y-Yes?!

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:29.390
You have to do your best! You need to wing the final one!

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:33.060
But all he said was Northern area...
How are we supposed to know where she

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:34.480
She's right here...!

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:36.640
Here?

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.050
Uh. Um...

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.180
Well... Actually...

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.110
Matsu-san?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:44.780
I don't want to be cremated yet!

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:46.660
Hey, Matsu-san!

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:47.970
Onii-chan.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:51.890
Is there someone just like Kuu was back then?

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:56.120
Well, I don't really know yet...

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.700
Onii-chan, will you go save her?

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.750
Tell me... Will you?

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:02.990
Kuu-chan...

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:05.590
Kuu was really lonely.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:09.050
I'd been crying there all alone.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.470
She... She must be...

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:15.930
crying too...

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:20.110
K-Kuu-chan, don't cry.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.520
You're right.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:29.450
Maybe this is something that only I can do.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:33.660
It's about time you start to believe in your own potential.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:38.420
If that girl really is crying and needs my help,

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.580
then I want to save her.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.290
I love you, Onii-chan!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.460
Kuu-chan?

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:49.640
So... Who was your first love, Kazehana-san?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:52.340
That's right, you still haven't told us.

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:54.140
Do you really want to know?

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.020
Yes, I want to know!

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:56.870
I'm at my limit...

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:57.310
It's not something to be ashamed of!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.730
Where should I start from?

00:17:58.800 --> 00:17:59.730
I'm heading out first.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.330
I'm going to get sick from staying in too long.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:06.190
Dammit... My body is already unstable as it is...

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.230
Kagari-san, what's wrong?

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.450
A-Are you all right?

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:17.620
Kagari-san!

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:24.920
K-Kagari-san, hang in there!

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:26.700
It's hot...

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.880
It feels as if my body is melting...

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:31.590
But...

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.440
I'll go get someone

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.320
It feels so good...

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:43.440
Kazehana... Are you serious?

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:46.320
Musubi is surprised too!

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:49.230
I said it!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:55.120
The previous crush of yours... was the president?!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.040
What the hell are you doing?!

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.330
That hurts, Takami-kun.

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:07.960
What have you done?

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.770
The Capital is too peaceful.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:16.090
Consider this tiny event a little present from the game master to the players.

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:20.450
Just to pass the time.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:35.020
I-I haven't been winged yet.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.630
I didn't want to think about it at all.

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:39.530
Even though I didn't want to think about it,

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:44.000
I was definitely reacting to this guy.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.310
It's only been a theory until now.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.980
My body is reacting to an Ashikabi...

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:55.120
And on top of that, the Ashikabi I'm reacting to is a guy.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:01.720
The changes in my body, and the body's reaction...

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.390
If it's all because of this guy...

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:07.270
If this guy is the reason for everything...

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.030
What was that?!

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:23.390
I-I can't control my own flame...

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:24.220
Why?!

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.780
Fire... Does this mean...?

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.030
W-Wait a second...

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:32.000
Wait...

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:35.920
Is he... a Sekirei?

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.500
What's going on? What was that flame just now?

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.150
Thank you, Tsukiumi.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.400
I've calmed down thanks to you.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:56.030
The person I'm supposed to kill is not you, Sahashi Minato.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:59.200
K-Kagari-san, you're...

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.160
Did I scare you? I'm sorry.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.370
But I won't apologize for punching you.

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:08.540
'Cause you're the first guy to ever touch my breasts.

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:13.490
Minato! D-Do you have that kind of interest as well?!

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:15.460
Interest...?

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:18.220
I don't! It was just soft...

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.140
Eh? Soft?

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:23.290
Kagari-san.

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:29.160
Minaka isn't a man who can be killed that easily.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:30.790
I know that.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.640
But... I can't stand it anymore.

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:37.610
My body is definitely reacting to an Ashikabi.

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:39.990
I'll be going, Miya.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.570
To kill Minaka.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:44.710
Homura...

