strong feelings

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:21.740
I'm Higa-sama's loyal subordinate, Kagizaki.

00:23:21.740 --> 00:23:25.700
I'm a man who can analyze and execute Higa-sama's orders without fail.

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:27.410
But you didn't have a name before,

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:30.240
and the staff called you the "side character with glasses" (truth).

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:32.250
No. 10, you promised not to tell anyone...

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:34.130
Fifth Wing: The Fire Sekirei.

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:35.790
Tune in next week, and forever and ever.
